# 运行时采样、进程状态、沙箱输出和演示录像不进入源码仓库。
# 可公开的摘要与截图放在docs/evidence；需要采样数据时，从core/fixtures
# 重新生成明确标记的受控负载结果，不直接发布整个运行工作目录。
core/evidence/
*.pid
runner.state
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-*
*.db
*.webm
*.mp4
*.pprof
*.hprof
*.jfr
*.perf.data
*.perf.data.old
*.perf-script
*.profile
*.prof
*.dump
*.fdata
*.folded
*.bin
*.elf
*.pprof.gz
*.hprof.gz
*.jfr.gz
*.folded.gz

# 显式导入的解析夹具是可丢弃玩具数据，具有可复现生成器及SHA-256/大小清单，
# 不能把这些样本解释成真实业务profile或现场性能证据。
!analyzer/tests/fixtures/golden.folded
!analyzer/tests/fixtures/collected/*.pprof
!analyzer/tests/fixtures/collected/*.hprof
!analyzer/tests/fixtures/collected/*.jfr
!analyzer/tests/fixtures/collected/*.profile
!analyzer/tests/fixtures/collected/*.fdata
!analyzer/tests/fixtures/collected/*.folded
!analyzer/tests/fixtures/collected/*.bin
!analyzer/tests/fixtures/collected/*.elf
